    "body": ">Why would it?\r\n\r\nIt changes `selectionStart` and `selectionEnd`, and modifying them does fire a select event.\r\n\r\n`selectionchange` event behavior is much more consistent, maybe better to specify when select event should not fire (mouse dragging) and otherwise always pair both events.",
